S.selectedBottomSheetRadioItem(this, 'SEARCH_TX_CD', 'HASCCHA2005', '역학과 에너지');\">\n        <span class=\"check__text\">역학과 에너지</span>\n    </label>\n</li>\n\n<li class=\"check__item\">\n    <label class=\"check__label\">\n        <input class=\"check__input\" name=\"type-2\" type=\"radio\" onclick=\"filterCLS.selectedBottomSheetRadioItem(this, 'SEARCH_TX_CD', 'HASCCHA2006', '물질과 에너지');\">\n        <span class=\"check__text\">물질과 에너지</span>\n    </label>\n</li>\n\n<li class=\"check__item\">\n    <label class=\"check__label\">\n        <input class=\"check__input\" name=\"type-2\" type=\"radio\" onclick=\"filterCLS.selectedBottomSheetRadioItem(this, 'SEARCH_TX_CD', 'HASCCHA2007', '세포와 물질대사');\">\n        <span class=\"check__text\">세포와 물질대사</span>\n    </label>\n</li>\n\n<li class=\"check__item\">\n    <label class=\"check__label\">\n        <input class=\"check__input\" name=\"type-2\" type=\"radio\" onclick=\"filterCLS.selectedBottomSheetRadioItem(this, 'SEARCH_TX_CD', 'HASCCHA2008', '지구시스템과학');\">\n        <span class=\"check__text\">지구시스템과학</span>\n    </label>\n</li>\n\n</ul>\n</div>\n        <div class=\"content__footer\" id=\"bottomSheetLayerFooter\"></div>\n    </div>\n</div>",
